0.01: Initial tenkyu release, derived from Orbit 0.06. Use tenkyu as the app ID, source directory, module names and storage filenames. Preserve the Sun-Earth-Moon clock, integrated calendar, place selection and civil-time options. Add Roman I-XII labels twice around the lunar orbit for a 24-hour scale, with 6-12 pixel font size and 1/2/3/6-hour spacing. Install as an independent app without importing legacy data or changing the default clock automatically.
